ITEM 3: LEVEL STATUS & LEVEL PROGRESSION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Problem Reported:
  "Level status and level progression are not showing correctly. Please fix the
   complete level calculation and status logic."

* Root Cause:
  In mobile_app/lib/screens/navigation/home_screen.dart (_buildTeamTab), line 2841,
  the table logic was reading:
    `final int realTeamCount = _teamMembers.where(...).length;`
  `_teamMembers` represents DIRECT referrals (usually 0 to 2 users), NOT the
  Single-Leg Cycle downlines (which count up to 126 members).
  Because direct referral count was checked against 126-member targets, Level 2
  through Level 6 remained permanently "Locked" even when 126 cycle members were active.

* Fixation Done:
  1. Linked the 6-Level Business Plan table directly to the single-leg cycle members
     count (`_membersCount`, 0 to 126):
     - Level 1 (2 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 2
     - Level 2 (4 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 6
     - Level 3 (8 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 14
     - Level 4 (16 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 30
     - Level 5 (32 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 62
     - Level 6 (64 Members): Completed when cumulative members >= 126
  2. Status dynamically transitions:
     - "Completed" (Green badge) once level target is met.
     - "In Progress" (Amber badge) for the current active level being built.
     - "Locked" (Gray badge) for subsequent unreached levels.

* Current Status:
  RESOLVED & VERIFIED. Level progression and level statuses reflect the actual
  Single-Leg team count in real time.

