ITEM 4: 6TH LEVEL INCOME CREDIT & BACKEND CALCULATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Problem Reported:
  "6th Level Income is not being generated/credited. Please open and check one
   complete/top ID and verify the full backend calculation. I already shared the
   video regarding this issue."

* Root Cause:
  In backend/routes/cycles.routes.js:
  1. Milestone 6 was labeled `'Single Leg Top User Income (126 Members Complete)'`
     instead of Level 6, causing frontend transaction filters searching for "Level"
     to fail to categorize it as Level Income.
  2. The payout ladder milestone naming was inverted (Level 5 payout mapped to Level 1 threshold).

* Fixation Done:
  In backend/routes/cycles.routes.js, aligned milestones to the exact Business Plan:
  - Milestone 1 (2 members): ₹200.00 -> `Single Leg Level 1 Income (2 Members)`
  - Milestone 2 (6 members): ₹400.00 -> `Single Leg Level 2 Income (6 Members)`
  - Milestone 3 (14 members): ₹800.00 -> `Single Leg Level 3 Income (14 Members)`
  - Milestone 4 (30 members): ₹1,600.00 -> `Single Leg Level 4 Income (30 Members)`
  - Milestone 5 (62 members): ₹3,200.00 -> `Single Leg Level 5 Income (62 Members)`
  - Milestone 6 (126 members): ₹6,400.00 -> `Single Leg Level 6 Income (126 Members Complete)`
  Total User Level Income per complete cycle:
    ₹200 + ₹400 + ₹800 + ₹1,600 + ₹3,200 + ₹6,400 = ₹12,600.00.
  When 126 members is reached:
  - ₹6,400 is credited immediately to user's Main Wallet.
  - Cycle status is updated to "COMPLETED".
  - Company Level Pool Surplus (+₹11,400.00) is automatically recorded.

* Current Status:
  RESOLVED & VERIFIED. Level 6 income is correctly credited and tracked.

